@S3UploadStarter_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

GET {{S3UploadStarter_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

###

POST {{S3UploadStarter_HostAddress}}/api/uploads
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=uploadBoundary

--uploadBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="hello.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

Hello from the S3 Upload Starter.
--uploadBoundary--
